<view class="page profile-page">
  <view class="page-title">我的</view>
  <view class="page-subtitle">记录都在这台手机里，简单看一眼就够了。</view>

  <view class="profile-card">
    <view class="profile-name">货小玲</view>
    <view class="profile-subtitle">你的生意事务，随手记下来、整理出来。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">这台手机里的记录</view>
    <view class="profile-grid">
      <view class="profile-stat">
        <view class="profile-number">{{stats.customers}}</view>
        <view class="profile-label">客户</view>
      </view>
      <view class="profile-stat">
        <view class="profile-number">{{stats.orders}}</view>
        <view class="profile-label">订单</view>
      </view>
      <view class="profile-stat">
        <view class="profile-number">{{stats.receivables}}</view>
        <view class="profile-label">待收</view>
      </view>
      <view class="profile-stat">
        <view class="profile-number">{{stats.todos}}</view>
        <view class="profile-label">提醒</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">当前状态</view>
    <view class="status-line">
      <text>记录整理</text>
      <text class="status-pill">{{parseStatus}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="status-line">
      <text>语音输入</text>
      <text class="{{voiceStatusClass}}">{{voiceStatus}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted status-note">语音会先转成文字；金额、客户和日期请在确认卡里核对。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card catalog-card">
    <view class="row-between">
      <view>
        <view class="card-title">我的商品规格库 {{catalogProducts.length}}</view>
        <view class="muted catalog-intro">确认保存的订单和报价会自动记住商品、规格和常用单位。</view>
      </view>
      <button class="catalog-add-button" bindtap="startAddCatalog">添加</button>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{showCatalogEditor}}" class="catalog-editor">
      <view class="field">
        <text class="label">商品名称</text>
        <input class="input" value="{{catalogName}}" data-field="catalogName" bindinput="updateCatalogField" placeholder="例如：耳饰" />
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <text class="label">常用规格</text>
        <textarea class="input catalog-textarea" value="{{catalogSpecsText}}" data-field="catalogSpecsText" bindinput="updateCatalogField" placeholder="例如：紫色、红色、珍珠款（用逗号分开）"></textarea>
      </view>
      <view class="catalog-editor-grid">
        <view class="field">
          <text class="label">数量单位</text>
          <input class="input" value="{{catalogUnitsText}}" data-field="catalogUnitsText" bindinput="updateCatalogField" placeholder="个、盒" />
        </view>
        <view class="field">
          <text class="label">计价单位</text>
          <input class="input" value="{{catalogPriceUnitsText}}" data-field="catalogPriceUnitsText" bindinput="updateCatalogField" placeholder="个、打" />
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="button-row catalog-editor-actions">
        <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="cancelCatalogEdit">取消</button>
        <button class="primary-button" bindtap="saveCatalog">保存商品资料</button>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{!catalogProducts.length && !showCatalogEditor}}" class="catalog-empty">还没有商品资料。确认第一笔订单后会自动出现在这里，也可以手动添加。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{catalogProducts}}" wx:key="id" class="catalog-item">
      <view class="catalog-item-head">
        <view class="catalog-item-name">{{item.productName}}</view>
        <view class="catalog-item-actions">
          <text data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="editCatalog">修改</text>
          <text class="catalog-delete" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="deleteCatalog">移除</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="catalog-item-line">规格：{{item.specText || '暂未记录'}}</view>
      <view class="catalog-item-line">单位：{{item.unitText || '-'}} · 计价：{{item.priceUnitText || '-'}} · 已使用 {{item.useCount || 0}} 次</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">记录提醒</view>
    <view class="muted">当前记录保存在这台设备；换手机或清理小程序数据前请谨慎。</view>
  </view>
</view>
